WEBVTT

00:14.000 --> 00:15.080
<b>Yuri!</b>

00:28.330 --> 00:31.540
<b>Yikes! This doesn't look good!</b>

00:31.580 --> 00:35.420
<b>HS 3rd Year                     HS 3rd Year                          HS 3rd Year
Renge Serizawa             Asuha Kusunoki                  Anko Tsubuzaki</b>

00:32.080 --> 00:33.170
<b>Sir...</b>

00:34.420 --> 00:36.290
<b>Kusunoki, you up for this?</b>

00:36.460 --> 00:37.630
<b>Yessir.</b>

00:37.880 --> 00:39.290
<b>High school 3rd year team, let's move!</b>

00:39.290 --> 00:40.250
<b>Wha-?</b>

00:40.420 --> 00:41.500
<b>Misaki is...!</b>

00:42.420 --> 00:43.130
<b>Move!</b>

00:46.710 --> 00:47.420
<b>Take this!</b>

01:07.130 --> 01:09.540
<b>Wow! They did it!</b>

01:17.830 --> 01:18.920
<b>Hoshimori.</b>

01:19.080 --> 01:22.290
<b>Donning their celestial suits
with the power of the Holy Tree,</b>

01:22.290 --> 01:27.420
<b>they stand as humanity's only hope
against the mysterious Irous invaders.</b>

01:27.880 --> 01:33.170
<b>And this, this is the story
of both their battles and their comradery.</b>

01:36.790 --> 01:42.830
<b>Now among the stars that stretch as far as the eye can see,
find the constellation of your dreams</b>

01:42.830 --> 01:51.290
<b>Bring your hearts together 
and someday it will come true</b>

01:59.580 --> 02:04.540
<b>Are you ready to run for it?</b>

02:05.000 --> 02:10.080
<b>The road is long, but you've 
got your friends with you</b>

02:10.500 --> 02:14.790
<b>Instead of just making faces and worrying</b>

02:14.790 --> 02:19.710
<b>Just go in head-first with a smile</b>

02:20.290 --> 02:25.750
<b>As hearts cross even in mere passing</b>

02:25.750 --> 02:28.500
<b>They will grow into deeper bonds</b>

02:28.500 --> 02:35.630
<b>Bring them together as one and find 
the power to take on the future</b>

02:36.290 --> 02:42.130
<b>Now look up to the stars as far as the eye can see
and keep chasing that dream</b>

02:42.130 --> 02:47.540
<b>That outreached hand will 
encourage you not to give up</b>

02:47.540 --> 02:53.040
<b>No matter how many hundreds of 
tries it takes, you're not alone</b>

02:53.040 --> 03:00.040
<b>You can do it, look up, 
there's surely a starry sky</b>

03:00.040 --> 03:02.880
<b>Your dreams will come true</b>

03:06.040 --> 03:08.830
<b>Mimi, you haven't finished your meal.</b>

03:09.920 --> 03:11.630
<b>But I'm so full already...</b>

03:11.670 --> 03:15.580
<b>HS 1st Year                                                                  HS 1st Year
Miki Hoshitsuki                                                           Haruka Narumi</b>

03:11.790 --> 03:13.540
<b>That was delicious!</b>

03:13.830 --> 03:15.960
<b>Miki, you've got rice on your face.</b>

03:15.960 --> 03:16.880
<b>Huh?</b>

03:19.750 --> 03:21.000
<b>Oh my!</b>

03:21.000 --> 03:24.580
<b>PLEASE! Do that one more time!</b>

03:24.830 --> 03:26.670
<b>Renge, not while we're eating.</b>

03:26.670 --> 03:29.710
<b>Oh come on, they were just so cute!</b>

03:29.710 --> 03:31.540
<b>That's a great shot.</b>

03:31.540 --> 03:33.790
<b>Send that my way later.</b>

03:33.790 --> 03:36.630
<b>So you like these cuties too, do you?</b>

03:36.630 --> 03:40.460
<b>JS 2nd Year                                                                            JS 2nd Year
Kaede Sendoin                                                                     Michelle Watagi</b>

03:36.750 --> 03:37.880
<b>That's a secret.</b>

03:37.880 --> 03:39.960
<b>Oh is it now?</b>

03:43.250 --> 03:45.080
<b>Wh-what are you playing at?</b>

03:49.750 --> 03:51.880
<b>You're quite dedicated, aren't you?</b>

03:52.580 --> 03:56.500
<b>Oh, good morning, Sakura, Sadone.</b>

03:54.130 --> 03:57.330
<b>JS 1st Year                                                                       JS 1st Year
Sadone                                                                            Sakura Fujimiya</b>

03:58.170 --> 03:59.500
<b>They're so pretty!</b>

04:01.080 --> 04:02.460
<b>Thank you!</b>

04:02.460 --> 04:04.790
<b>A testament to your devotion indeed.</b>

04:04.830 --> 04:09.130
<b><i>HS 2nd Year
Kurumi Tokiwa</i></b>

04:05.130 --> 04:08.000
<b>What are these flowers called?</b>

04:10.540 --> 04:12.630
<b>These are irises.</b>

04:12.630 --> 04:15.130
<b>They're part of the Iridaceae 
family of flowers.</b>

04:15.830 --> 04:17.750
<b>And they're supposed to represent...</b>

04:17.750 --> 04:22.750
<b>Episode 5
The Meaning of the Iris</b>

04:25.250 --> 04:28.380
<b>Okay! Looks like I've got you all here.</b>

04:28.380 --> 04:29.880
<b>Let's jump right into today's training.</b>

04:29.880 --> 04:31.580
<b>But we don't have everyone!</b>

04:31.920 --> 04:32.540
<b>Huh?</b>

04:32.580 --> 04:36.670
<b>HS 2nd Year
Nozomi Amano
Yuri Himukai</b>

04:32.790 --> 04:34.290
<b>Misaki isn't here.</b>

04:34.290 --> 04:37.290
<b>Ah, true, but well...</b>

04:37.630 --> 04:40.040
<b>So? Same as every other day.</b>

04:41.080 --> 04:43.880
<b>Isn't this training supposed to be
for ALL Hoshimori members?</b>

04:44.250 --> 04:46.420
<b>Why does Misaki always get to skip out?</b>

04:46.710 --> 04:49.290
<b>As head of the school disciplinary committee,
I cannot allow this!</b>

04:50.290 --> 04:53.460
<b>Well, I did tell her about today...</b>

04:55.920 --> 05:00.080
<b>You know, I'd like you to start joining us
after class for training.</b>

05:00.290 --> 05:01.170
<b>I don't need to.</b>

05:02.080 --> 05:03.670
<b>"Don't need to"?</b>

05:03.670 --> 05:07.040
<b>I stand to gain nothing from them.</b>

05:08.210 --> 05:11.130
<b>So there's absolutely no reason 
for me to train with them.</b>

05:16.170 --> 05:19.540
<b>But I don't suppose I can 
tell them that, can I...?</b>

05:22.000 --> 05:25.290
<b>Yuri! You're going at this too hard!</b>

05:28.080 --> 05:33.460
<b>Left with no other choice, humankind
headed for the Colony protected by the Holy Tree.</b>

05:33.790 --> 05:37.000
<b>Now, five years after this 
so-called "Judgment Day" —</b>

05:37.250 --> 05:39.960
<b>Here on the colony watched 
over by the Holy Tree...</b>

05:37.250 --> 05:40.000
<b>HS 1st Year
Misaki</b>

06:16.080 --> 06:17.250
<b>Sniff sniff.</b>

06:17.250 --> 06:19.880
<b>Wh-what the-?! What are you doing?!</b>

06:20.210 --> 06:23.420
<b>I smell... doubt on you.</b>

06:29.460 --> 06:30.290
<b>Wait!</b>

06:32.750 --> 06:34.750
<b>I'll scrub you down.</b>

06:42.330 --> 06:44.790
<b>Wh-what's going on here...?</b>

07:16.880 --> 07:20.790
<b>You know, Misaki, you remind 
me of how Yuri used to be.</b>

07:21.460 --> 07:24.170
<b>N-no way! How so?</b>

07:24.630 --> 07:28.000
<b>The way you always keep 
everything pent up inside...</b>

07:30.080 --> 07:35.500
<b>And the way you pressure yourself
so much to grow stronger.</b>

07:36.920 --> 07:39.000
<b>I'm part of the Hoshimori team.</b>

07:39.000 --> 07:41.630
<b>Any one of us should aim to grow stronger.</b>

07:43.540 --> 07:47.830
<b>True. Even I still think 
I need to be stronger.</b>

07:48.500 --> 07:49.920
<b>I'm sure everyone does.</b>

07:50.920 --> 07:53.130
<b>Then why do you all act that way?!</b>

07:55.420 --> 07:57.000
<b>Weakness is our enemy.</b>

07:57.000 --> 08:01.210
<b>Why can't you see how your own weaknesses
put your friends in danger?</b>

08:01.750 --> 08:03.130
<b>Friends...</b>

08:05.750 --> 08:09.540
<b>So you haven't always fought 
alone like you do now.</b>

08:11.630 --> 08:15.330
<b>Yeah... I had a team of my own once too...</b>

08:16.000 --> 08:20.420
<b>They were strong friends who 
were always there for me.</b>

08:21.710 --> 08:26.790
<b>But I was foolish, counted on them too much,
and grew weak.</b>

08:27.130 --> 08:29.710
<b>And then, because of that...</b>

08:33.960 --> 08:35.460
<b>Misaki...</b>

08:35.920 --> 08:39.040
<b>That's why I want to be even stronger.</b>

08:39.250 --> 08:41.790
<b>Strong enough to never need help.</b>

08:42.080 --> 08:42.920
<b>Ever.</b>

08:44.460 --> 08:47.170
<b>Stronger than anyone.</b>

08:47.170 --> 08:50.750
<b>So strong you don't need anyone...</b>

08:53.250 --> 08:54.210
<b>But...</b>

08:55.210 --> 09:00.210
<b>I feel like sometimes there might be
strength in teamwork.</b>

09:01.710 --> 09:06.420
<b>At least, I know a certain 
duo who work that way.</b>

09:14.500 --> 09:16.540
<b>So there you are.</b>

09:20.420 --> 09:21.080
<b>Here.</b>

09:21.080 --> 09:22.670
<b>Huh? Really?</b>

09:22.670 --> 09:24.540
<b>Know what? Never mind!</b>

09:25.880 --> 09:27.540
<b>What are you trying to-?</b>

09:28.960 --> 09:31.710
<b>You're thinking about her, aren't you?</b>

09:31.710 --> 09:33.080
<b>Y-yeah...</b>

09:34.000 --> 09:36.630
<b>Misaki's breaking the rules.</b>

09:36.960 --> 09:38.460
<b>But she's plenty strong.</b>

09:38.460 --> 09:40.830
<b>That's why it sticks out all the more!</b>

09:41.500 --> 09:44.330
<b>You know, she reminds 
me a lot of the old you!</b>

09:44.580 --> 09:46.500
<b>What?! How?</b>

09:46.630 --> 09:50.080
<b>The way she just runs headfirst
without a thought for anyone else.</b>

09:52.540 --> 09:56.580
<b>Well, the way she skips out on training
reminds me of the old you.</b>

10:03.000 --> 10:05.330
<b>How long has it been?</b>

10:04.750 --> 10:07.960
<b>2 years ago</b>

10:05.880 --> 10:08.580
<b>You know, I don't even remember.</b>

10:17.630 --> 10:18.330
<b>Begin!</b>

10:41.500 --> 10:42.380
<b>That's enough!</b>

10:59.540 --> 11:05.130
<b>Yuri, you eating like that
makes me almost feel bad for that hamburger.</b>

11:05.290 --> 11:09.210
<b>I just can't stand it! You 
see the way she treated me?!</b>

11:09.670 --> 11:13.250
<b>What do you expect?
The upperclassmen are super strong.</b>

11:13.250 --> 11:15.250
<b>But it was three on two!</b>

11:15.250 --> 11:17.750
<b>Jeez, finish chewing before you speak!</b>

11:18.040 --> 11:20.130
<b>I think we need more 
training! Training, I say!</b>

11:20.630 --> 11:21.630
<b>Training?</b>

11:21.630 --> 11:25.250
<b>You heard me! Tomorrow morning,
6 A.M. in the school yard!</b>

11:25.630 --> 11:30.380
<b>The three of us, we're gonna train
until they can't beat us anymore!</b>

11:31.710 --> 11:33.500
<b>You're really set on this, huh?</b>

11:33.710 --> 11:35.080
<b>Of course!</b>

11:36.380 --> 11:40.330
<b>I mean, the fate of the 
human race depends on us!</b>

11:43.210 --> 11:44.670
<b>I'll pass.</b>

11:44.670 --> 11:45.380
<b>Huh?</b>

11:45.380 --> 11:46.630
<b>Why?!</b>

11:46.830 --> 11:47.750
<b>Because...</b>

11:48.580 --> 11:51.000
<b>lack of beauty sleep is no 
good for a girl's complexion!</b>

11:52.630 --> 11:55.130
<b>Waking up that early just to train?</b>

11:55.710 --> 11:57.920
<b>That's not very ladylike now is it?</b>

11:59.290 --> 12:01.170
<b>Wait! Nozomi!</b>

12:16.170 --> 12:18.630
<b>She's not coming, is she?</b>

12:19.880 --> 12:22.880
<b>Fine then. We'll practice by ourselves.</b>

12:23.080 --> 12:24.830
<b>O-okay...</b>

12:28.000 --> 12:28.920
<b>G'morning!</b>

12:28.920 --> 12:29.830
<b>Nozomi!</b>

12:29.830 --> 12:30.710
<b>Yikes...</b>

12:34.000 --> 12:36.330
<b>Where were you this morning?!</b>

12:36.750 --> 12:40.540
<b>What? I told you I'd pass.</b>

12:40.750 --> 12:44.330
<b>But if we don't step it up, 
we'll never get stronger.</b>

12:44.330 --> 12:47.960
<b>And if we don't, we won't be any good
as part of Hoshimori now, will we?</b>

12:48.330 --> 12:51.210
<b>You know, I don't really care about all that.</b>

12:51.790 --> 12:55.170
<b>If you want to get stronger, 
well go right ahead then.</b>

12:55.540 --> 12:56.920
<b>Nozomi, are you...?</b>

12:56.920 --> 12:57.790
<b>Yuri...</b>

12:57.790 --> 12:59.750
<b>Now then, I'll be going.</b>

12:59.750 --> 13:02.170
<b>Wait! We aren't finished here!</b>

13:02.170 --> 13:04.540
<b>But class is about to start.</b>

13:04.830 --> 13:07.830
<b>We can't have the head of the
school disciplinary committee be late.</b>

13:16.170 --> 13:17.750
<b>Oh I am SO mad!</b>

13:19.880 --> 13:24.710
<b>Yuri, I know how you must feel,
but you shouldn't get so angry.</b>

13:26.880 --> 13:31.880
<b>Nozomi must have some reason
for saying all the stuff she did...</b>

13:36.210 --> 13:38.830
<b>I know. Of course she does.</b>

13:40.460 --> 13:44.830
<b>But if she doesn't talk,
how are we supposed to know what it is?</b>

13:46.000 --> 13:49.960
<b>Yuri Himukai (2nd Year HS)
Birthday: August 14th  
Sign: Leo 
Blood Type: A   
Measurements: 72/55/79 
Height: 148cm  
Weight: 38kg 
Hobby: Dog walking  
Idol: Miyamoto Musashi 
Favorite food: Ochazuke
Dislikes: Octopus</b>

13:50.040 --> 13:54.000
<b>Nozomi Amano (2nd Year HS)
Birthday: July 7th   
Sign: Cancer 
Blood Type: O   
Measurements: 86/54/84 
Height: 160cm   
Weight: 44kg 
Hobby: Fashion   
Idol: Her mother 
Favorite food: Beef stew
Dislikes: Mayo</b>

13:58.330 --> 14:00.290
<b>So there you are.</b>

14:09.290 --> 14:13.750
<b>Nozomi, you haven't said 
a word to Yuri all day...</b>

14:14.540 --> 14:15.670
<b>Why?</b>

14:16.460 --> 14:19.830
<b>I know I'm in the wrong here.</b>

14:20.380 --> 14:25.330
<b>We're the Hoshimori team.
The last hope for planet earth.</b>

14:30.630 --> 14:33.500
<b>But... I'm scared...</b>

14:34.380 --> 14:36.250
<b>Scared of fighting the Irous?</b>

14:36.960 --> 14:39.880
<b>There's that too, but...</b>

14:40.380 --> 14:45.080
<b>But it's more of how everyone's future
rests on our shoulders.</b>

14:50.210 --> 14:51.710
<b>It's true though, right?</b>

14:51.920 --> 14:55.580
<b>If we lose, the whole earth is doomed!</b>

14:56.130 --> 14:59.540
<b>It's all...! It's...</b>

15:02.630 --> 15:04.080
<b>It's too scary...</b>

15:04.920 --> 15:06.000
<b>What if...</b>

15:06.000 --> 15:08.790
<b>What if we lose and it's all my fault?</b>

15:09.290 --> 15:12.790
<b>But that's exactly why Yuri wants to train-</b>

15:12.790 --> 15:14.170
<b>I know!</b>

15:17.830 --> 15:21.710
<b>But I'm not like that.</b>

15:23.500 --> 15:26.540
<b>I can't be strong the way she can...</b>

15:28.380 --> 15:29.540
<b>Nozomi...</b>

15:41.630 --> 15:42.830
<b>Where's Nozomi?</b>

15:43.380 --> 15:46.790
<b>I'm sorry, I couldn't 
get in touch with her...</b>

15:48.830 --> 15:52.290
<b>Jeez. Right when we're about to move out.</b>

15:52.290 --> 15:55.460
<b>So be it. We don't have time.</b>

15:55.630 --> 15:58.130
<b>I'll try and get a hold of her.</b>

15:58.830 --> 16:01.000
<b>The rest of you, move out.</b>

16:01.000 --> 16:02.000
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

16:12.500 --> 16:14.880
<b>Transfer coordinates set.</b>

16:16.500 --> 16:18.380
<b>All right. Here we go!</b>

16:18.500 --> 16:19.830
<b>Commencing teleportation!</b>

16:22.670 --> 16:23.670
<b>Listen up.</b>

16:23.670 --> 16:29.080
<b>I'm sure you know, but your objective
is to clear out all remaining Irous in the area.</b>

16:29.630 --> 16:31.830
<b>Form a line and push them back.</b>

16:32.130 --> 16:35.170
<b>Drive them back to the 
other side of the river!</b>

16:35.170 --> 16:36.170
<b>Roger that.</b>

16:35.790 --> 16:38.250
<b>EMERGENCY CALL</b>

16:39.080 --> 16:41.130
<b>Why? Just why...?</b>

16:43.880 --> 16:45.540
<b>That stupid Nozomi!</b>

16:57.960 --> 16:59.420
<b>EMERGENCY CALL</b>

17:11.580 --> 17:13.500
<b>EMERGENCY CALL</b>

17:12.710 --> 17:13.460
<b>It's no good.</b>

17:14.080 --> 17:15.960
<b>She's not answering any of my calls.</b>

17:16.710 --> 17:19.750
<b>Yuri, don't move ahead alone!
You're going to get surrounded!</b>

17:19.750 --> 17:22.380
<b>I'm fine. Nothing but weaklings out here.</b>

17:22.670 --> 17:24.460
<b>I'll get to the river first and-</b>

17:25.830 --> 17:27.960
<b>What's the matter? Give me a report!</b>

17:29.380 --> 17:30.750
<b>No way...</b>

17:30.750 --> 17:34.790
<b>Why is such a huge one still 
out in a place like this...?</b>

17:40.920 --> 17:42.460
<b>What? Yuri is...</b>

17:43.670 --> 17:45.920
<b>I wish I could say I'd go help, but...</b>

17:46.130 --> 17:48.630
<b>We're all pretty strapped as it is!</b>

17:48.880 --> 17:50.710
<b>Let me head to her!</b>

17:52.420 --> 17:53.710
<b>I can save her.</b>

17:54.080 --> 17:57.790
<b>No. If you fall out of formation 
the line won't hold.</b>

17:58.130 --> 18:00.380
<b>That will just put you all at risk.</b>

18:27.880 --> 18:29.670
<b>You're late, Nozomi!</b>

18:29.670 --> 18:32.210
<b>I was scared, okay?!</b>

18:33.380 --> 18:37.080
<b>I was scared of these Irous!
Scared of the future resting on my shoulders!</b>

18:38.130 --> 18:40.130
<b>Why are you here then?</b>

18:40.380 --> 18:41.580
<b>For you!</b>

18:41.580 --> 18:42.750
<b>Yuri...!</b>

18:43.790 --> 18:45.710
<b>The thought of losing you...</b>

18:46.330 --> 18:47.380
<b>That was just...</b>

18:47.750 --> 18:49.580
<b>scarier than anything else!</b>

18:55.080 --> 18:59.130
<b>Leave the small-fry to me. You 
take on that big one there!</b>

19:13.080 --> 19:14.080
<b>Fine then.</b>

19:14.420 --> 19:16.830
<b>Let me show you what I'm REALLY capable of!</b>

19:35.040 --> 19:39.630
<b>I never said anything then, 
but I was scared too.</b>

19:40.420 --> 19:41.580
<b>That's why...</b>

19:42.250 --> 19:45.630
<b>That's why you always went all-in
trying to get even stronger, right?</b>

19:46.460 --> 19:47.750
<b>You knew?!</b>

19:49.790 --> 19:51.250
<b>Of course I did!</b>

19:53.130 --> 19:55.460
<b>You and I, we know each other.</b>

20:01.130 --> 20:02.130
<b>Sniff sniff.</b>

20:04.710 --> 20:06.750
<b>What a wonderful fragrance.</b>

20:10.210 --> 20:11.580
<b>Huh?</b>

20:11.580 --> 20:14.630
<b>Next up is Dome Park?</b>

20:15.750 --> 20:18.960
<b>I'm so popular now it almost hurts...</b>

20:25.210 --> 20:28.170
<b>Strength born from teamwork, huh...?</b>

20:32.040 --> 20:35.000
<b>I just wanted to be stronger.</b>

20:35.330 --> 20:38.380
<b>That's all. I just wanted to be stronger.</b>

20:39.670 --> 20:44.330
<b>I wanted to be strong enough 
to fight alongside her.</b>

20:47.330 --> 20:48.330
<b>But...</b>

21:10.920 --> 21:11.750
<b>Oh!</b>

21:12.960 --> 21:15.380
<b>Pretty fond of flowers, huh?</b>

21:16.080 --> 21:17.170
<b>Oh yes.</b>

21:18.000 --> 21:20.080
<b>Especially these irises.</b>

21:20.080 --> 21:25.170
<b>I planted them as a sign of me, Yuri,
and Nozomi getting back together.</b>

21:28.000 --> 21:32.330
<b>Say, do you know what 
irises stand for, Misaki?</b>

21:33.330 --> 21:36.790
<b>No... I'm not big on that sort of stuff...</b>

21:38.540 --> 21:39.500
<b>Friendship.</b>

21:41.040 --> 21:42.210
<b>Trust.</b>

21:43.460 --> 21:44.580
<b>And...</b>

21:45.710 --> 21:47.040
<b>hope.</b>

21:51.750 --> 21:53.000
<b>Hope...</b>

22:12.500 --> 22:18.960
<b>Things should be moving, 
but they feel stopped</b>

22:18.960 --> 22:25.290
<b>I contemplate alone, pretending to understand</b>

22:25.290 --> 22:31.710
<b>But with the end of each 
twinkle reason draws away</b>

22:31.710 --> 22:37.500
<b>Reflected in my pupils as running noise</b>

22:37.500 --> 22:44.040
<b>Consciousness trapped 
away in a lonely rondeau</b>

22:44.290 --> 22:47.710
<b>When it's held up, make your escape</b>

22:47.710 --> 22:53.080
<b>And let us perform together</b>

22:53.210 --> 23:00.040
<b>There's no one to decide but you yourself</b>

23:00.040 --> 23:06.210
<b>Whether right or wrong, it 
will all start to seem fine</b>

23:06.210 --> 23:13.000
<b>One over the other, if you believe 
it will come true someday</b>

23:13.000 --> 23:21.830
<b>The blank music score will be 
filled with a one of a kind</b>

23:22.080 --> 23:25.080
<b>Ring out melody</b>

23:27.630 --> 23:32.170
<b>Now that I've taken Kurumi's place,
there's all sorts of stuff I'd like to do!</b>

23:32.170 --> 23:34.920
<b>What? N-no, stop that!</b>

23:35.040 --> 23:37.920
<b>Next time: "Renge is Kurumi 
and Kurumi is Renge."</b>

23:35.960 --> 23:40.960
<b>Next Episode
Renge is Kurumi and Kurumi is Renge
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

23:38.540 --> 23:40.540
<b>Time for some girl watching!</b>
